in the heart of the strip you can't miss  its neon signs and packed parking lot  located off Las Vegas Boulevard and  Convention Center Drive the Peppermill  Restaurant is a testament of its time  still standing in its original location  which was once surrounded by big name  casinos like the Stardust and the  Riviera the Peppermill opened its doors  December 26 1972 and has become a  favorite staple for many over the years  once inside you're transported back in  time with its retro but modern day decor  and Fireside Lounge which has served as  a backdrop in numerous films and TV  shows such as casino and Giada at home  executive chef Nicholas orth says  there's a place for everybody from  locals to tourists and celebrities such  as Floyd Mayweather and Chris Angel just  to name a few my dad's worked here  uncles named every member of my family  has worked here previously in the past  so pepper Mill's in my blood so this  place celebrating 50 years of just an  amazing experience for my family and  everybody else also known for its huge  portions of food and unique atmosphere  locals like Harry Spiro keep coming back  for the Nostalgia I've been coming here  for 47 years  and uh first time I came here was 1975  and I had a Denver omelette and 47 years  later I had another Denver album I  brought my kids with me so show them the  history of this place uh this place  hasn't changed the waitresses are still  wearing the same uniforms gonna keep  bringing them here and my grandkids Sage  skate evader from San Diego also brings  his family and friends every time they  visit it's really fun environment the  food is great and really get a feel of  Las Vegas with a lot of the personal  touches uh waitresses seem like they're  in a good mood and it's just a fun  atmosphere Chef ort was already  preparing for the next 50 years with new  AC units Cutlery and more he wants to  keep that atmosphere going they have  expectations when they come to the door  this is what I had last time the time  before that time before that I want to  be sure that we make up that we live up  to those expectations  want to celebrate its 50th Pepper Mill  having a party Monday morning at 9 30  cake balloons and food specials and  they're expecting special guests  including Penn and Teller join the  celebration at 9 30 a.m congrats to the  Peppermill a lot of Peppermill fans here  at Channel 8
 

